{title: Now And Forevermore}
{subtitle: Psalms 121:7–8}
{key: Bb}
{tempo: 72}
{time: 4/4}

{comment: Intro}
| [Bb] | [Bb] | [Eb] | [Bb] |
| [Eb] |

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Bb]The sun will not strike you by [Eb]day
[Gm7]Nor the moon by [Eb]night
[Bb]The Lord [Bbmaj7]is your shade at your [Eb]right side
[Gm]Protecting your [Eb]sight
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[Bb]The Lord will [F]keep you from all [Eb]harm
[Gm]He will [F]watch over [Eb]your life
[Bb]The Lord will watch [F]over your [Gm7]going [Eb]out
And your coming in
Now and forever[Bb]more [Eb]
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Bb]He who watches over [Eb]Israel
[Gm7]Neither slumbers nor [Eb]sleeps
[Bb]He sees every step [Eb]of your life
[Gm7]While you quietly [Eb]weeps
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[Bb]The Lord will [F]keep you from all [Eb]harm
[Gm7]He will [F]watch over [Eb]your life
[Bb]The Lord will [F]watch over your [Gm]going [Eb]out
And your coming in
Now and forever[Bb]more
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_bridge: Bridge}
[Gm]From the morning [Eb]light to the dark
[Bb]He is near to your [F]heart
[Gm]No shadow of [Eb]harm can remain
When his watch is the [F]same
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[Bb]The Lord will [F]keep you from all [Eb]harm
[Gm7]He will [F]watch over [Eb]your life
[Bb]The Lord [F]will watch over [Gm7]your going [Eb]out
And your coming in
Now and forever[Bb]more
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Outro}
[Eb]Now and forever[Gm7]more
[Eb]He watches over you [Bb]
{end_of_verse}
